1
00:00:01,793 --> 00:00:05,088
[theme music playing]

2
00:00:13,096 --> 00:00:14,764
[laughs]

3
00:00:35,618 --> 00:00:37,871
[Helena] <i>She's so pathetic.</i>
<i>Look at her. Bye!</i>

4
00:00:37,954 --> 00:00:41,124
[Lily] <i>You just let her escape!</i>
<i>She's gone!</i>

5
00:00:41,207 --> 00:00:44,919
<i>You know, Agent Salonga,</i>
<i>I'd be careful if I were you.</i>

6
00:00:45,003 --> 00:00:47,005
<i>I think my suspicions are correct.</i>

7
00:00:47,088 --> 00:00:48,840
<i>There's a snake among us.</i>

8
00:00:48,923 --> 00:00:51,134
<i>What's the latest update on Red Dragon?</i>

9
00:00:51,217 --> 00:00:53,428
[Romulo] <i>We've retrieved</i>
<i>the pickup that rescued her.</i>

10
00:00:53,511 --> 00:00:54,888
<i>It's been secured downstairs.</i>

11
00:00:54,971 --> 00:00:57,390
<i>We're tracking down its owner.</i>

12
00:00:57,474 --> 00:01:00,518
[Lily] <i>The pickup that attacked us</i>
<i>while Red Dragon was escaping</i>

13
00:01:00,602 --> 00:01:03,605
<i>is registered under</i>
<i>one of your businesses.</i>

14
00:01:03,688 --> 00:01:06,733
[Lily] <i>You aren't going to hell</i>
<i>just yet, Asuncion.</i>

15
00:01:06,816 --> 00:01:08,943
<i>The Big Four want to set a meeting.</i>

16
00:01:09,027 --> 00:01:11,112
<i>Big Four? And who the hell are they?</i>

17
00:01:11,196 --> 00:01:13,573
<i>They are the four leaders of</i>
<i>Red Dragon's operations</i>

18
00:01:13,656 --> 00:01:15,825
<i>in the north, south, east,</i>
<i>and west areas of the country.</i>

19
00:01:15,909 --> 00:01:17,368
<i>Shouldn't we be talking about</i>

20
00:01:17,452 --> 00:01:19,412
<i>who's going to replace Red Dragon?</i>

21
00:01:19,496 --> 00:01:22,999
<i>It's quite obvious that I should take</i>
<i>Red Dragon's place</i>

22
00:01:23,083 --> 00:01:24,876
<i>since I'm her only daughter.</i>

23
00:01:24,959 --> 00:01:26,795
<i>Why don't we have an election?</i>

24
00:01:26,878 --> 00:01:30,340
<i>Emilia versus me</i>
<i>for Red Dragon's position.</i>

25
00:01:30,423 --> 00:01:31,925
[Lily] <i>If you're not with Red Dragon,</i>

26
00:01:32,008 --> 00:01:35,845
<i>then you work for another group</i>
<i>that helped her escape.</i>

27
00:01:35,929 --> 00:01:38,306
[Agent Asuncion] <i>You can't stop Red Dragon</i>

28
00:01:38,389 --> 00:01:41,226
<i>because she's already left the country.</i>

29
00:01:41,309 --> 00:01:46,189
<i>While Mama Dragon is away,</i>
<i>I want my baby dragon to slay.</i>

30
00:01:46,272 --> 00:01:47,982
[Emilia] <i>The queen is back.</i>

31
00:01:48,066 --> 00:01:49,901
[chuckles]

32
00:01:52,612 --> 00:01:56,116
Macau, Hong Kong, Taiwan.

33
00:01:56,199 --> 00:01:59,160
If Red Dragon has really
left the Philippines,

34
00:01:59,244 --> 00:02:02,372
she could have fled to one
of those three destinations.

35
00:02:02,455 --> 00:02:03,623
Places in the north.

36
00:02:03,706 --> 00:02:05,416
Nearby places which are easy to get to.

37
00:02:05,500 --> 00:02:07,252
It's also alleged to be the headquarters

38
00:02:07,335 --> 00:02:09,295
of a huge network of an Asian triad.

39
00:02:13,466 --> 00:02:14,342
Triad?

40
00:02:16,177 --> 00:02:18,680
I could be wrong about this,

41
00:02:19,556 --> 00:02:22,058
which is why we must
study this more thoroughly

42
00:02:22,142 --> 00:02:25,770
before involving foreign intelligence
in Red Dragon's case.

43
00:02:26,980 --> 00:02:28,022
Never mind.

44
00:02:28,731 --> 00:02:31,317
I have a spy in Red Dragon's organization.

45
00:02:31,901 --> 00:02:34,988
We can keep track of their every move.

46
00:02:35,989 --> 00:02:39,117
And hopefully, that'll help us
take down Red Dragon herself.

47
00:02:39,200 --> 00:02:44,205
[tense music playing]

48
00:03:00,221 --> 00:03:02,056
Like I said before.

49
00:03:02,140 --> 00:03:03,933
My hunch about Diego was right.

50
00:03:04,934 --> 00:03:05,977
Take a look.

51
00:03:11,107 --> 00:03:16,195
[unsettling music playing]

52
00:03:32,670 --> 00:03:33,671
[grunts]

53
00:03:48,144 --> 00:03:49,479
[groaning]

54
00:03:49,562 --> 00:03:50,480
[yells]

55
00:03:51,814 --> 00:03:54,317
Arnaldo, calm down.
What's happening to you?

56
00:03:54,400 --> 00:03:56,277
Look at me! Look at me! What did you see?

57
00:03:56,361 --> 00:03:58,905
Ivy. Ivy. Ivy. Ivy!

58
00:04:00,198 --> 00:04:01,199
Ivy…

59
00:04:03,117 --> 00:04:04,953
Here, Arnaldo, take your medicine.

60
00:04:05,036 --> 00:04:06,704
I don't need that!

61
00:04:07,080 --> 00:04:08,331
Arnaldo.

62
00:04:08,414 --> 00:04:09,499
[panting]

63
00:04:09,582 --> 00:04:13,878
You take your medicines
because you need to get well.

64
00:04:13,962 --> 00:04:16,881
Especially now that I've been reinstated

65
00:04:16,965 --> 00:04:20,260
as the governor of our province.

66
00:04:20,343 --> 00:04:22,303
Do you know what that means?

67
00:04:22,387 --> 00:04:23,846
I need you to get well

68
00:04:23,930 --> 00:04:27,100
so that you can take my place
once I step down!

69
00:04:27,183 --> 00:04:29,686
You are going to assume
my place as governor,

70
00:04:29,769 --> 00:04:32,146
so get your act together!

71
00:04:37,568 --> 00:04:38,820
I'm sorry.

72
00:04:39,821 --> 00:04:41,030
Sorry, Grandpa.

73
00:04:47,120 --> 00:04:48,246
Doctor.

74
00:04:48,579 --> 00:04:53,042
Will you please explain to me
what's happening to my grandson?

75
00:04:53,126 --> 00:04:55,878
At this point, his memories
are all rushing back,

76
00:04:55,962 --> 00:04:57,338
flooding his mind.

77
00:04:57,422 --> 00:04:59,048
He remembers things from his past,

78
00:04:59,132 --> 00:05:02,093
and at the same time, he also
remembers recent events.

79
00:05:02,176 --> 00:05:05,096
He remembers being
devotional and religious.

80
00:05:05,179 --> 00:05:07,390
It's all rushing back to him.

81
00:05:07,974 --> 00:05:11,227
I do not need a grandson

82
00:05:11,311 --> 00:05:15,982
who is a half-wit, half-sane, half-crazy,

83
00:05:16,065 --> 00:05:19,360
half-man-of-God, half-
I don't know what anymore!

84
00:05:19,444 --> 00:05:22,989
What I need is Arnaldo, the old Arnaldo!

85
00:05:23,072 --> 00:05:26,534
The Arnaldo I brought up,
the Arnaldo I trained.

86
00:05:26,617 --> 00:05:31,039
The Mayor Arnaldo
who's ruthless and cunning.

87
00:05:31,122 --> 00:05:32,373
Yes, Governor.

88
00:05:32,457 --> 00:05:34,083
But this is difficult for Arnaldo.

89
00:05:34,167 --> 00:05:37,086
His mind has to sort out
all these memories.

90
00:05:37,170 --> 00:05:39,505
Please, have some more patience.

91
00:05:40,506 --> 00:05:42,300
Patience?

92
00:05:42,383 --> 00:05:46,095
Patience is a virtue for the poor

93
00:05:46,179 --> 00:05:47,764
because they have no choice

94
00:05:47,847 --> 00:05:50,892
but to be patient with
the sorry state they're in!

95
00:05:50,975 --> 00:05:54,854
I just got reinstated as
the governor of this province,

96
00:05:54,937 --> 00:05:58,191
and you ask me to be patient?!

97
00:05:58,274 --> 00:06:00,443
Cure my grandson!

98
00:06:01,569 --> 00:06:02,737
Papa.

99
00:06:03,821 --> 00:06:05,364
And you.

100
00:06:05,448 --> 00:06:07,116
You're also testing me.

101
00:06:07,200 --> 00:06:09,452
If you haven't been trying so hard

102
00:06:09,535 --> 00:06:13,122
to become the leader
of your mother's group,

103
00:06:13,206 --> 00:06:15,792
you would've known how pitiful
your son's condition is!

104
00:06:15,875 --> 00:06:19,170
Doctor Go is the best
psychiatrist in town, Papa!

105
00:06:19,253 --> 00:06:22,507
And please, let me correct you,
I am not desperate,

106
00:06:22,590 --> 00:06:25,468
because Mama told me
that I'd be replacing her.

107
00:06:25,551 --> 00:06:27,845
Didn't you tell me before
to seize the power?

108
00:06:27,929 --> 00:06:29,472
Well, so I did!

109
00:06:29,555 --> 00:06:31,599
Big deal!

110
00:06:32,975 --> 00:06:35,103
You're being toyed with.

111
00:06:35,186 --> 00:06:37,355
You know what the truth is?

112
00:06:37,438 --> 00:06:40,316
If you truly want to lead her group,

113
00:06:40,399 --> 00:06:44,821
if you want them to see you
as someone powerful,

114
00:06:44,904 --> 00:06:48,950
you have to kill those four big
shots your mother works with!

115
00:06:49,033 --> 00:06:52,370
Then, and only then,
will you have true power.

116
00:06:52,453 --> 00:06:57,875
Then, and only then, will you
be recognized as a leader.

117
00:06:57,959 --> 00:07:01,254
Without that, you're nothing.

118
00:07:02,296 --> 00:07:04,006
You're just a figurehead.

119
00:07:04,090 --> 00:07:07,718
This is not a game, Emilia!

120
00:07:26,904 --> 00:07:29,949
Didn't you challenge me before
to look for evidence

121
00:07:30,032 --> 00:07:32,410
that would prove you're a spy?

122
00:07:32,493 --> 00:07:35,538
Well, there you go.
That's evidence enough, I'd say.

123
00:07:39,876 --> 00:07:41,502
What's all this?

124
00:07:42,670 --> 00:07:43,504
Seriously?

125
00:07:45,631 --> 00:07:47,925
Are you trying to test my patience?

126
00:07:48,009 --> 00:07:49,594
-Am I?
-Are you?

127
00:07:51,095 --> 00:07:53,055
Both of you stop it.

128
00:07:53,139 --> 00:07:54,849
Diego, take a seat.

129
00:07:56,142 --> 00:07:57,185
Sit down.

130
00:08:03,483 --> 00:08:05,776
So, what do you have to say for yourself?

131
00:08:05,860 --> 00:08:07,236
What does it look like?

132
00:08:07,320 --> 00:08:08,738
I was just organizing the documents.

133
00:08:08,821 --> 00:08:09,947
Really now?

134
00:08:11,574 --> 00:08:13,284
Well, hand me your phone then.

135
00:08:13,367 --> 00:08:15,119
[tense music playing]

136
00:08:16,496 --> 00:08:19,332
What's holding you back now?

137
00:08:19,415 --> 00:08:21,209
You're hiding something, aren't you?

138
00:08:28,049 --> 00:08:30,301
Let me remind you that unlike you,

139
00:08:30,384 --> 00:08:32,470
I am not one of Red Dragon's goons.

140
00:08:32,553 --> 00:08:35,640
I am her ally, and that
was what we agreed upon.

141
00:08:35,723 --> 00:08:37,850
You can't treat me as if I'm some goon.

142
00:08:37,934 --> 00:08:40,895
Unless I'm certain of your loyalty, Diego,

143
00:08:40,978 --> 00:08:43,606
I cannot just trust you blindly.

144
00:08:44,857 --> 00:08:48,361
Take him to the other room, and
don't take your eyes off him.

145
00:08:50,321 --> 00:08:51,781
I can go there myself.

146
00:08:51,864 --> 00:08:56,869
[tense music playing]

147
00:09:01,123 --> 00:09:06,128
[suspenseful music playing]

148
00:09:20,977 --> 00:09:21,936
Give me that.

149
00:09:26,482 --> 00:09:30,820
Once I prove that
Torillo's a spy, I'll kill him.

150
00:09:30,903 --> 00:09:35,908
[suspenseful music playing]

151
00:09:40,454 --> 00:09:44,250
I'm worried that
Mercedes has Diego's phone.

152
00:09:44,333 --> 00:09:48,713
I've been trying to contact him
all day, but he's not answering.

153
00:09:48,796 --> 00:09:52,675
Then I have to delete all
your messages to each other.

154
00:09:52,758 --> 00:09:55,803
I hope nothing bad happens to Diego.

155
00:09:55,886 --> 00:09:58,514
I need to talk to him.

156
00:09:58,598 --> 00:10:01,142
I need to know if he's okay.

157
00:10:01,225 --> 00:10:02,643
But how?

158
00:10:02,727 --> 00:10:04,687
Maybe I can help.

159
00:10:04,770 --> 00:10:07,189
Where's Diego? I'll go to him.

160
00:10:07,273 --> 00:10:10,026
Damian, Diego's in a difficult position.

161
00:10:10,109 --> 00:10:11,986
It's impossible for you to help.

162
00:10:12,069 --> 00:10:13,904
But I can try.

163
00:10:16,240 --> 00:10:18,284
He's at Red Dragon's base.

164
00:10:18,367 --> 00:10:20,453
Do you know where that is?

165
00:10:20,536 --> 00:10:24,290
I used to be in a gang
with Red Dragon's former men.

166
00:10:24,373 --> 00:10:27,335
I'll find a way to give him your message.

167
00:10:27,418 --> 00:10:29,754
No, you might just get in danger.

168
00:10:29,837 --> 00:10:31,964
I can take care of myself.

169
00:10:32,048 --> 00:10:34,300
I'll do anything to help you.

170
00:10:45,061 --> 00:10:47,480
[whistles]

171
00:10:49,148 --> 00:10:51,859
Your aura's different today, Emilia.

172
00:10:51,942 --> 00:10:55,863
It's like you're very powerful.
You have such a strong appeal.

173
00:10:55,946 --> 00:10:58,824
-Do I?
-Yeah.

174
00:10:58,908 --> 00:11:03,287
You know, I heard your
conversation with your Papa.

175
00:11:03,371 --> 00:11:04,955
Don't think about it.

176
00:11:06,540 --> 00:11:09,210
I am different from your father.

177
00:11:10,961 --> 00:11:12,463
I'm proud of you.

178
00:11:16,550 --> 00:11:19,762
By the way, about your Mama's business…

179
00:11:19,845 --> 00:11:25,309
Turns out, she's more than just a jeweler.

180
00:11:25,393 --> 00:11:27,895
True enough, I was right.

181
00:11:27,978 --> 00:11:30,898
Helena Montoya is Red Dragon.

182
00:11:31,857 --> 00:11:35,236
And now, you're Baby Dragon.

183
00:11:35,319 --> 00:11:38,906
Can you imagine that? That's so great!

184
00:11:38,989 --> 00:11:40,866
You know, Raul, if you're sucking up to me

185
00:11:40,950 --> 00:11:43,494
so you can be part of our organization,

186
00:11:43,577 --> 00:11:45,287
you gotta stop right now.

187
00:11:46,956 --> 00:11:47,998
How come?

188
00:11:48,082 --> 00:11:51,794
[scoffs] Because it's a gangster world
and you won't fit in.

189
00:11:51,877 --> 00:11:54,296
Wow. Gangster world.

190
00:11:54,380 --> 00:11:56,215
Emilia, in case you've forgotten,

191
00:11:56,298 --> 00:12:00,344
I run all of your father's
illegal businesses here.

192
00:12:00,428 --> 00:12:01,512
Alone.

193
00:12:02,388 --> 00:12:05,850
Raul, if I'm going to have
a business partner,

194
00:12:05,933 --> 00:12:10,146
it should be the fake Jaguar,
because he's very manly

195
00:12:10,229 --> 00:12:12,022
and he's the king of the underworld.

196
00:12:12,106 --> 00:12:14,900
I am the queen, so I need a king.

197
00:12:14,984 --> 00:12:19,155
But since you're funny,
you could be the… joker.

198
00:12:19,238 --> 00:12:20,322
[chuckles]

199
00:12:25,453 --> 00:12:26,662
Joker, huh?

200
00:12:31,876 --> 00:12:35,963
Did you know that Emilia
is replacing Red Dragon?

201
00:12:36,881 --> 00:12:37,882
What?!

202
00:12:38,924 --> 00:12:42,344
You're telling me that Emilia
is taking her mother's place?

203
00:12:42,428 --> 00:12:44,472
-Yes.
-Are you serious?

204
00:12:44,555 --> 00:12:45,806
What's wrong with that?

205
00:12:48,350 --> 00:12:51,103
Emilia is my nemesis.

206
00:12:53,355 --> 00:12:55,566
She can't win over me again.

207
00:12:56,317 --> 00:12:57,526
That can't happen.

208
00:12:58,861 --> 00:13:00,488
You have to teach me the ropes.

209
00:13:01,655 --> 00:13:04,617
Teach me everything I need
to know about the syndicate.

210
00:13:06,160 --> 00:13:09,914
I need to win when I face Emilia again.

211
00:13:09,997 --> 00:13:11,081
Please!

212
00:13:11,749 --> 00:13:12,750
Okay.

213
00:13:14,627 --> 00:13:15,794
Stop!

214
00:13:15,878 --> 00:13:18,005
-Why?
-I'm serious!

215
00:13:19,423 --> 00:13:20,466
You know what?

216
00:13:21,717 --> 00:13:25,137
A beautiful woman like you
shouldn't be working.

217
00:13:26,096 --> 00:13:29,350
You should just be worshipped
by men like me.

218
00:13:31,227 --> 00:13:35,814
That or you just see me as a sex kitten.

219
00:13:35,898 --> 00:13:39,693
I'm not a toy! I'm a woman!

220
00:13:39,777 --> 00:13:41,529
And I have a brain.

221
00:13:41,612 --> 00:13:44,198
A big one, in fact.

222
00:13:44,281 --> 00:13:45,616
So get out!

223
00:13:46,116 --> 00:13:47,910
Get out? I own this place.

224
00:13:47,993 --> 00:13:50,412
I don't care if this is your place.

225
00:13:50,496 --> 00:13:52,289
This is my room, so get out.

226
00:13:52,373 --> 00:13:53,999
I said get out!

227
00:13:54,083 --> 00:13:55,960
Okay, okay. Fine.

228
00:13:56,043 --> 00:13:57,503
Get out!

229
00:14:01,715 --> 00:14:02,675
Hurry!

230
00:14:11,267 --> 00:14:13,269
[grunts]

231
00:14:18,983 --> 00:14:23,988
[suspenseful music playing]

232
00:14:35,708 --> 00:14:38,878
Leave us. I need to speak
with Diego in private.

233
00:14:38,961 --> 00:14:40,254
You can't do that.

234
00:14:40,337 --> 00:14:43,549
Mercedes said Diego can't talk to anyone

235
00:14:43,632 --> 00:14:45,384
without her permission.

236
00:14:45,467 --> 00:14:46,468
[scoffs]

237
00:14:47,303 --> 00:14:51,807
Let me just remind you where you stand.

238
00:14:51,891 --> 00:14:54,518
This is you, and this is me.

239
00:14:54,602 --> 00:14:56,854
Who's on top?

240
00:14:56,937 --> 00:14:58,272
Me.

241
00:14:58,355 --> 00:15:00,816
Who gives the orders? I do.

242
00:15:00,900 --> 00:15:02,443
So, you three get out.

243
00:15:02,526 --> 00:15:04,236
Have some coffee or snacks,

244
00:15:04,320 --> 00:15:07,448
or take a dip in the swimming pool.

245
00:15:07,531 --> 00:15:09,033
Out.

246
00:15:09,116 --> 00:15:11,952
-As you wish, sir.
-There we go.

247
00:15:22,546 --> 00:15:23,797
Read this.

248
00:15:29,261 --> 00:15:30,346
What's this?

249
00:15:31,347 --> 00:15:33,474
-Where's this from?
-It's from Lily.

250
00:15:45,319 --> 00:15:47,571
Pick out every tenth word in the article

251
00:15:47,655 --> 00:15:49,698
to get Lily's message.

252
00:16:00,000 --> 00:16:02,378
HOW ARE YOU?

253
00:16:04,254 --> 00:16:13,180
JEPOY HAS ERASED OUR MESSAGES
ON THE CELL PHONE

254
00:16:13,263 --> 00:16:17,851
IN CASE THEY CONFISCATE IT FROM YOU.

255
00:16:19,728 --> 00:16:23,190
I LOVE YOU SO MUCH.

256
00:16:24,066 --> 00:16:25,943
How did you get this?

257
00:16:26,944 --> 00:16:30,572
No questions. What matters
is you can talk to Lily.

258
00:16:30,656 --> 00:16:32,992
If you want to tell her anything…

259
00:16:33,993 --> 00:16:35,494
…write it here.

260
00:16:35,577 --> 00:16:40,582
[suspenseful music playing]

261
00:17:05,649 --> 00:17:07,026
Yes, Natalie.

262
00:17:08,110 --> 00:17:10,404
You're reduced to this.

263
00:17:11,405 --> 00:17:14,366
Dating an older man for power.

264
00:17:16,785 --> 00:17:19,413
You and I both know

265
00:17:19,496 --> 00:17:22,458
that you only want one man.

266
00:17:34,011 --> 00:17:39,058
[tense music playing]

267
00:17:55,240 --> 00:17:56,575
[phone chimes]

268
00:18:18,847 --> 00:18:20,182
[phone chimes]

269
00:18:40,244 --> 00:18:45,249
[soft music playing]

270
00:18:49,795 --> 00:18:53,006
I LOVE ANNA.

271
00:19:10,774 --> 00:19:11,942
[phone chimes]

272
00:19:14,736 --> 00:19:16,947
-I LOVE ANNA.
-What?!

273
00:19:19,658 --> 00:19:20,701
Ew.

274
00:19:21,702 --> 00:19:23,328
That's weird.

275
00:19:28,125 --> 00:19:31,420
You want me, you don't want me…

276
00:19:31,503 --> 00:19:34,464
You want me, you don't want me…

277
00:19:34,548 --> 00:19:36,800
You want me!

278
00:19:38,260 --> 00:19:39,511
You want me!

279
00:19:42,890 --> 00:19:45,267
Torillo pulled a fast one on us again!

280
00:19:45,350 --> 00:19:47,644
He couldn't have deleted
the files on this phone!

281
00:19:47,728 --> 00:19:50,230
That guy is a traitor!
Believe me, Mercedes!

282
00:19:50,314 --> 00:19:54,818
We can't do anything to Diego
without any solid proof.

283
00:19:54,902 --> 00:19:56,320
We'll answer to Red Dragon

284
00:19:56,403 --> 00:19:59,198
if she finds out you're picking on him.

285
00:19:59,281 --> 00:20:00,741
She still has some use for Diego,

286
00:20:00,824 --> 00:20:02,618
so lay off him for now.

287
00:20:02,701 --> 00:20:07,706
[unsettling music playing]

288
00:20:13,587 --> 00:20:15,672
You have something that's mine?

289
00:20:20,344 --> 00:20:25,307
[tense music playing]

290
00:20:57,547 --> 00:20:59,007
Is everyone ready?

291
00:21:01,176 --> 00:21:02,094
Okay, great.

292
00:21:06,431 --> 00:21:11,270
As you can see,
I am well, alive, and kicking.

293
00:21:11,353 --> 00:21:12,646
And while I'm away,

294
00:21:12,729 --> 00:21:15,899
I am entrusting my position
to my baby girl.

295
00:21:15,983 --> 00:21:18,026
My Baby Dragon…

296
00:21:23,282 --> 00:21:25,325
Emilia Ardiente-Torillo.

297
00:21:30,664 --> 00:21:32,499
To my Dragon Team,

298
00:21:32,582 --> 00:21:34,209
be good to my Baby Dragon

299
00:21:34,293 --> 00:21:36,712
if you don't want to be burnt to a crisp.

300
00:21:47,347 --> 00:21:48,390
Goodbye.

301
00:21:51,810 --> 00:21:56,773
[clapping]

302
00:22:02,738 --> 00:22:05,824
Now that you've heard Red Dragon's message

303
00:22:05,907 --> 00:22:08,910
that I'll be taking her place
while she's away,

304
00:22:10,162 --> 00:22:12,247
does anyone want to say anything?

305
00:22:20,464 --> 00:22:21,882
Mercedes?

306
00:22:23,592 --> 00:22:26,219
Anyway, I'm inviting everyone for dinner.

307
00:22:26,303 --> 00:22:28,430
I'm also inviting the Big Four.

308
00:22:28,513 --> 00:22:32,184
Including you, Mercedes.
You're free to join us.

309
00:22:35,812 --> 00:22:37,564
I told you, didn't I?

310
00:22:37,647 --> 00:22:40,609
This throne suits me better than you.

311
00:22:42,986 --> 00:22:44,654
Right, Mercedes?

312
00:22:46,490 --> 00:22:49,242
I think you'd prefer that I keep quiet

313
00:22:49,326 --> 00:22:51,495
than hear what I have to say.

314
00:22:53,580 --> 00:22:55,082
But, you know, Mercedes?

315
00:22:55,165 --> 00:22:59,086
I am willing to listen
to what you want to say.

316
00:23:01,505 --> 00:23:03,340
I was raised by Red Dragon.

317
00:23:04,216 --> 00:23:07,969
I grew up seeing that she
always made the right decision.

318
00:23:08,887 --> 00:23:10,597
Except for now.

319
00:23:10,680 --> 00:23:13,558
How can I respect an ex-politician,

320
00:23:13,642 --> 00:23:15,477
a good-for-nothing Ardiente,

321
00:23:15,560 --> 00:23:20,440
who's taking the place of the woman
I've idolized almost all my life?

322
00:23:21,483 --> 00:23:24,444
You are not my queen,
and you will never be.

323
00:23:25,070 --> 00:23:28,031
I'd rather die than kneel before you.

324
00:23:31,660 --> 00:23:35,080
[groaning]

325
00:23:37,958 --> 00:23:39,209
Emilia!

326
00:23:41,419 --> 00:23:44,422
[gasping]

327
00:23:45,549 --> 00:23:47,509
[Mercedes coughing]

328
00:23:47,592 --> 00:23:49,803
-[groans]
-[grunts]

329
00:23:52,722 --> 00:23:54,349
-[coughing]
-Vanessa.

330
00:23:54,432 --> 00:23:56,643
-You know what to do with her.
-Yes, Madam.

331
00:24:05,026 --> 00:24:07,154
[grunts] Stop! Let go of me!

332
00:24:09,531 --> 00:24:11,867
[grunts]

333
00:24:11,950 --> 00:24:14,786
How dare you, Emilia?!

334
00:24:14,870 --> 00:24:18,373
I'll have my revenge! Remember that!

335
00:24:18,456 --> 00:24:21,751
Let go! [gasping]

336
00:24:21,835 --> 00:24:23,295
I said let go!

337
00:24:27,090 --> 00:24:30,177
I'm giving everyone in this
room the opportunity to tell me

338
00:24:30,260 --> 00:24:33,096
whatever they want in front of my face.

339
00:24:33,180 --> 00:24:36,558
But don't you ever dare
question my capabilities

340
00:24:36,641 --> 00:24:40,312
or belittle my name
the way that woman did!

341
00:24:41,938 --> 00:24:43,106
I've learned many things

342
00:24:43,190 --> 00:24:46,193
from being the mayor
and governor of this town.

343
00:24:46,276 --> 00:24:47,736
And don't you ever dare think

344
00:24:47,819 --> 00:24:49,738
that I became the leader of this faction

345
00:24:49,821 --> 00:24:51,781
just because I'm Red Dragon's daughter!

346
00:24:51,865 --> 00:24:53,533
Is that clear?

347
00:25:00,457 --> 00:25:01,458
Good.

348
00:25:03,501 --> 00:25:08,506
[ominous music playing]

349
00:25:17,974 --> 00:25:19,517
You may all go.

350
00:25:19,601 --> 00:25:24,564
[ominous music playing]

351
00:25:40,789 --> 00:25:45,669
[groaning, grunting]

352
00:26:16,283 --> 00:26:21,288
[suspenseful music playing]

353
00:26:43,810 --> 00:26:48,773
[tense music playing]

354
00:26:52,193 --> 00:26:55,280
Thank you, Doctor. You can go now.

355
00:27:11,296 --> 00:27:12,922
Hi.

356
00:27:13,006 --> 00:27:14,299
[moans]

357
00:27:15,300 --> 00:27:18,970
Take it easy. You were beat up pretty bad.

358
00:27:20,180 --> 00:27:24,100
Don't tell me you just
happened to be there

359
00:27:24,184 --> 00:27:27,145
when Emilia threw me out.

360
00:27:27,228 --> 00:27:30,815
And don't tell me you're
just a good Samaritan.

361
00:27:30,899 --> 00:27:32,484
[scoffs]

362
00:27:32,567 --> 00:27:36,071
We know each other very well, Lily Cruz.

363
00:27:36,154 --> 00:27:38,365
Are we still going to
beat around the bush?

364
00:27:39,824 --> 00:27:41,993
I don't like playing games.

365
00:27:45,830 --> 00:27:48,500
I want you to be part of my group.

366
00:27:48,583 --> 00:27:54,297
I want you to leave Red Dragon
so you can get back at Emilia.

367
00:27:54,381 --> 00:27:56,591
Once they press charges
against Red Dragon,

368
00:27:56,674 --> 00:28:00,637
you will testify against her.

369
00:28:00,720 --> 00:28:05,141
[chuckling]

370
00:28:05,225 --> 00:28:09,729
Yes, yes, Mercedes. Yes.
It might seem funny now.

371
00:28:09,813 --> 00:28:13,441
But before you know it,
we'll be on the same side.

372
00:28:15,944 --> 00:28:17,487
So, what do you think?

373
00:28:18,488 --> 00:28:21,825
Are you going to join my group or…

374
00:28:23,326 --> 00:28:27,205
Do you want to play
second fiddle to Emilia forever?

375
00:28:38,466 --> 00:28:39,759
Hi, love.

376
00:28:40,760 --> 00:28:41,761
Anna.

377
00:28:42,929 --> 00:28:45,765
Come on. I bought some bread. Let's eat.

378
00:28:51,855 --> 00:28:54,190
Oh! Sorry.

379
00:28:57,318 --> 00:29:00,739
Come on, Jepoy. Let's eat.
I bought a lot of bread.

380
00:29:01,865 --> 00:29:03,658
Choose what you want.

381
00:29:04,659 --> 00:29:05,869
Come on, love.

382
00:29:07,746 --> 00:29:09,748
My girlfriend is so sweet.

383
00:29:09,831 --> 00:29:11,249
Of course.

384
00:29:25,472 --> 00:29:26,639
Hold on.

385
00:29:28,224 --> 00:29:30,018
Are you okay?

386
00:29:30,101 --> 00:29:33,563
Why do you look distracted? Huh?

387
00:29:36,232 --> 00:29:41,237
[sensual music playing]

388
00:29:48,745 --> 00:29:49,829
Stop it.

389
00:30:00,256 --> 00:30:05,261
[sensual music playing]

390
00:30:16,981 --> 00:30:19,192
[gasps] Jepoy!

391
00:30:34,582 --> 00:30:37,502
Cut it… Jepoy! Stop!

392
00:30:45,218 --> 00:30:47,804
Jepoy? Anna?

393
00:30:52,976 --> 00:30:54,018
Anna.

394
00:30:58,439 --> 00:31:03,444
[soft tense music playing]

395
00:31:07,991 --> 00:31:08,992
Hey.

396
00:31:18,251 --> 00:31:20,295
Thanks, but no thanks.

397
00:31:22,297 --> 00:31:23,298
Wow.

398
00:31:25,758 --> 00:31:26,885
Unbelievable.

399
00:31:28,469 --> 00:31:31,472
You're still loyal to them.

400
00:31:31,556 --> 00:31:35,184
Even though they treat you like trash.

401
00:31:35,268 --> 00:31:40,106
I'm only loyal to myself.
I'm nobody's pet.

402
00:31:40,189 --> 00:31:42,942
I just saved your life.

403
00:31:43,026 --> 00:31:45,278
And I thank you for that.

404
00:31:45,361 --> 00:31:47,655
Just add it to my long list of debts

405
00:31:47,739 --> 00:31:50,158
because I'll be sure to pay you back.

406
00:31:50,241 --> 00:31:51,242
[chuckles]

407
00:31:53,119 --> 00:31:55,997
Prideful, aren't you, Mercedes?

408
00:31:56,080 --> 00:31:58,666
I only know my self-worth.

409
00:31:58,750 --> 00:32:00,460
But you don't know your value.

410
00:32:02,670 --> 00:32:05,882
Emilia is born to lead your faction,

411
00:32:05,965 --> 00:32:09,135
but you are made to rule.

412
00:32:10,094 --> 00:32:11,638
You deserve better.

413
00:32:12,889 --> 00:32:17,143
And you will see that
once you join my group.

414
00:32:19,520 --> 00:32:25,735
I'd much rather be alone
than become your little pet.

415
00:32:28,029 --> 00:32:32,909
You just made the biggest
mistake of your life, Mercedes.

416
00:32:34,160 --> 00:32:35,662
Now get some rest.

417
00:32:37,246 --> 00:32:39,749
Maybe once you're all healed up,

418
00:32:39,832 --> 00:32:44,462
you'll finally be able
to make rational decisions.

419
00:32:49,300 --> 00:32:54,305
[unsettling music playing]

420
00:33:13,950 --> 00:33:18,955
[soft music playing]

421
00:33:28,006 --> 00:33:29,966
Don't you want to have coffee first?

422
00:33:30,967 --> 00:33:32,010
Jepoy.

423
00:33:34,178 --> 00:33:39,183
[soft dramatic music playing]

424
00:34:07,336 --> 00:34:09,839
Natalie, this is for you.

425
00:34:11,549 --> 00:34:12,592
What's that?

426
00:34:13,593 --> 00:34:15,219
-A bribe?
-[chuckles]

427
00:34:15,303 --> 00:34:18,973
I have my own laptop, thank you very much.

428
00:34:19,807 --> 00:34:25,188
That laptop contains everything you need
to know about the southern faction.

429
00:34:25,772 --> 00:34:26,939
Isn't that what you wanted?

430
00:34:27,648 --> 00:34:29,734
To learn everything you can
about the syndicate?

431
00:34:33,946 --> 00:34:37,283
-And you're giving it to me?
-Of course!

432
00:34:37,366 --> 00:34:38,701
Because I want you to be happy.

433
00:34:39,702 --> 00:34:43,873
And don't worry.
Someday, all this will be yours.

434
00:34:45,500 --> 00:34:46,667
Even my men.

435
00:34:47,293 --> 00:34:48,461
You two, come here.

436
00:34:50,213 --> 00:34:53,758
Tell your comrades that from now on,

437
00:34:53,841 --> 00:34:57,512
you will obey all of Natalie's orders.

438
00:34:57,595 --> 00:34:59,555
-Is that clear?
-Yes, boss.

439
00:35:00,598 --> 00:35:03,392
Okay. Go, go. Go!

440
00:35:12,944 --> 00:35:14,237
Don't you want it?

441
00:35:21,327 --> 00:35:22,745
Are you happy?

442
00:35:22,829 --> 00:35:24,038
Yes, Daddy.

443
00:35:32,839 --> 00:35:34,882
This has everything?

444
00:35:34,966 --> 00:35:36,467
[chuckles]

445
00:35:36,551 --> 00:35:37,718
Everything you need.

446
00:35:37,802 --> 00:35:42,974
[ominous music playing]

447
00:35:44,976 --> 00:35:46,769
Thank you, Daddy.

448
00:35:46,853 --> 00:35:51,607
[ominous music playing]

449
00:35:58,573 --> 00:36:03,202
Emilia and Red Dragon's group
are planning a huge meeting.

450
00:36:03,286 --> 00:36:07,290
But we don't know what
the exact time and location are.

451
00:36:07,373 --> 00:36:11,335
It could be the perfect chance
to arrest them.

452
00:36:11,419 --> 00:36:12,587
Arrest?

453
00:36:14,046 --> 00:36:16,924
Emilia and the Big Four.

454
00:36:17,008 --> 00:36:18,217
And if we succeed,

455
00:36:18,301 --> 00:36:20,761
we'll be able to take down
the entire syndicate.

456
00:36:20,845 --> 00:36:23,389
I'll talk this over with Agent Salonga.

457
00:36:25,349 --> 00:36:29,061
What about Mercedes?
Do you think she'll attend?

458
00:36:29,145 --> 00:36:31,606
What if she rats you out to Emilia?

459
00:36:33,065 --> 00:36:35,943
She wouldn't dare let them
call her a traitor,

460
00:36:36,027 --> 00:36:38,613
so I know she won't, Mom.

461
00:36:38,696 --> 00:36:43,701
[tense music playing]

462
00:36:45,119 --> 00:36:47,705
I've received the contracts
you sent me, Mr. Castro.

463
00:36:47,788 --> 00:36:51,292
Let me just review them,
then I'll get back to you.

464
00:36:51,375 --> 00:36:52,460
Thank you.

465
00:36:57,423 --> 00:37:00,718
Thanks for letting me
stay here again, Lily.

466
00:37:00,801 --> 00:37:03,012
I realized I still have so many books here

467
00:37:03,095 --> 00:37:04,805
for the kids at the Sitio.

468
00:37:04,889 --> 00:37:07,183
You're welcome here anytime, Anna.

469
00:37:07,266 --> 00:37:08,893
You know that, right?

470
00:37:09,852 --> 00:37:12,855
By the way, where's Jepoy?

471
00:37:12,939 --> 00:37:16,817
Why isn't he with you?
He could've helped you out.

472
00:37:22,657 --> 00:37:25,076
What's the matter? Did you fight?

473
00:37:25,159 --> 00:37:27,536
No, Lily. We didn't.

474
00:37:37,463 --> 00:37:39,632
Well, that's what it looks like to me.

475
00:37:46,597 --> 00:37:48,599
[Natalie] Good morning, hot stuff.

476
00:37:48,683 --> 00:37:53,646
[sexy music playing]

477
00:37:57,984 --> 00:38:00,319
Ma'am, what are you doing here?

478
00:38:07,201 --> 00:38:09,161
-Good morning, Lily.
-Good morning, Anna.

479
00:38:09,245 --> 00:38:11,497
Hey, Marlon.

480
00:38:12,832 --> 00:38:15,835
Marlon can go with you to Sitio Onse.

481
00:38:15,918 --> 00:38:18,629
-Can you accompany Anna?
-Sure.

482
00:38:18,713 --> 00:38:20,548
Take care, Anna.

483
00:38:20,631 --> 00:38:22,008
Thanks, Lily.

484
00:38:22,091 --> 00:38:23,718
-Marlon.
-Sure.

485
00:38:24,885 --> 00:38:27,596
Are these books good to go?
Let's sort them out.

486
00:38:27,680 --> 00:38:32,727
[soft music playing]

487
00:38:44,989 --> 00:38:46,699
-I missed you.
-Ma'am.

488
00:38:49,827 --> 00:38:52,663
Ma'am, we've already talked about this.

489
00:38:52,747 --> 00:38:57,835
I know, but I'm trying…
I'm trying to move on.

490
00:38:58,878 --> 00:39:00,921
I really missed you.

491
00:39:01,005 --> 00:39:02,048
Ma'am.

492
00:39:04,967 --> 00:39:07,136
I'm dating someone new.

493
00:39:07,219 --> 00:39:08,346
And…

494
00:39:09,638 --> 00:39:13,768
He's a bit older than me,
but he's very powerful.

495
00:39:13,851 --> 00:39:16,896
He's actually part of
Red Dragon's Big Four.

496
00:39:18,731 --> 00:39:21,067
-Big Four?
-Mm-hmm.

497
00:39:21,150 --> 00:39:24,403
I don't really want to talk
about him right now.

498
00:39:24,487 --> 00:39:28,449
I came to see you. I missed you so much.

499
00:39:28,532 --> 00:39:31,202
I don't really have time
because he's nearby

500
00:39:31,285 --> 00:39:33,746
and he has a meeting.

501
00:39:33,829 --> 00:39:36,248
So… Do you want to do this quickly?

502
00:39:36,332 --> 00:39:40,002
Just… You know,
it'll just take a few minutes.

503
00:39:40,086 --> 00:39:42,546
-He's somewhere nearby?
-Like old times?

504
00:39:43,631 --> 00:39:44,632
Please?

505
00:39:47,635 --> 00:39:49,178
Why are you dressing up?

506
00:39:50,721 --> 00:39:51,847
Where are you going?

507
00:39:53,724 --> 00:39:55,101
Madrigal?

508
00:39:56,477 --> 00:39:58,562
Madrigal, come back!

509
00:39:59,939 --> 00:40:01,690
Thanks for the help, Marlon.

510
00:40:02,983 --> 00:40:04,610
Don't mention it.

511
00:40:04,693 --> 00:40:06,779
By the way, where's Jepoy?

512
00:40:06,862 --> 00:40:09,073
Wasn't he supposed to help you out?

513
00:40:10,408 --> 00:40:12,159
You two had a fight, didn't you?

514
00:40:13,160 --> 00:40:16,497
Fine, all right. We fought.

515
00:40:16,580 --> 00:40:17,998
I don't get you men.

516
00:40:18,082 --> 00:40:21,085
The moment the girl reciprocates,

517
00:40:21,168 --> 00:40:24,463
you think she's ready to go all the way.

518
00:40:25,631 --> 00:40:27,091
What do you mean?

519
00:40:28,843 --> 00:40:30,928
You know… All the way there.

520
00:40:31,971 --> 00:40:33,556
Whatever.

521
00:40:34,515 --> 00:40:35,516
[chuckles]

522
00:40:35,599 --> 00:40:38,644
Oh, "there." Okay.

523
00:40:38,727 --> 00:40:42,523
That's just how guys are.
It's no big deal.

524
00:40:44,108 --> 00:40:47,611
So, you admit that's
what all men think about?

525
00:40:48,696 --> 00:40:50,739
Well, not every guy.

526
00:40:50,823 --> 00:40:53,909
But that's what makes men
and women different.

527
00:40:55,327 --> 00:40:59,915
Tell you what, Anna.
Just talk straight up to Jepoy.

528
00:40:59,999 --> 00:41:01,834
I'm sure you two will figure things out.

529
00:41:01,917 --> 00:41:07,047
[soft music playing]

530
00:41:13,471 --> 00:41:17,641
If we catch the Big Four
and Emilia Ardiente,

531
00:41:17,725 --> 00:41:20,060
that will be our biggest arrest.

532
00:41:20,144 --> 00:41:22,021
All the ringleaders
and their factions here

533
00:41:22,104 --> 00:41:24,565
in the Philippines will fall apart.

534
00:41:24,648 --> 00:41:26,775
Then, we'll be able to find Red Dragon

535
00:41:26,859 --> 00:41:29,445
and destroy all the syndicates.

536
00:41:29,528 --> 00:41:32,865
It'll be one less problem
for Poblacion Ardiente.

537
00:41:34,742 --> 00:41:36,952
After that, Diego can come back to me.

538
00:41:44,293 --> 00:41:45,920
We have a problem, Governor.

539
00:41:46,003 --> 00:41:48,881
The Dragon Ladies won't accept our bribe

540
00:41:48,964 --> 00:41:51,217
in exchange for our gambling dens.

541
00:41:51,300 --> 00:41:54,220
Especially now that Emilia's their leader.

542
00:41:55,429 --> 00:41:56,514
Oh.

543
00:41:56,597 --> 00:41:57,973
Emilia…

544
00:41:58,974 --> 00:42:00,392
What is this?

545
00:42:00,476 --> 00:42:01,685
I mean…

546
00:42:02,853 --> 00:42:06,524
Why won't the Dragon Ladies

547
00:42:06,607 --> 00:42:10,361
accept my bribe in exchange
for my gambling dens?

548
00:42:10,444 --> 00:42:13,739
Well, we're not surrendering
that piece of territory

549
00:42:13,822 --> 00:42:17,159
because it's one of
our biggest moneymakers.

550
00:42:18,410 --> 00:42:20,162
In case you've forgotten…

551
00:42:21,330 --> 00:42:25,501
That place used to belong
to the Ardientes.

552
00:42:28,254 --> 00:42:30,339
And in case you've forgotten, Papa,

553
00:42:30,422 --> 00:42:33,884
Mama snatched it away from you
when you weren't governor,

554
00:42:33,968 --> 00:42:36,345
so you can't take it away from me.

555
00:42:37,346 --> 00:42:38,556
[chuckles]

556
00:42:39,682 --> 00:42:41,767
Well, would you look at that.

557
00:42:42,726 --> 00:42:45,521
Now, that you're finally on top…

558
00:42:46,522 --> 00:42:48,774
You've become so full of yourself.

559
00:42:48,857 --> 00:42:50,818
Come on, Papa.

560
00:42:50,901 --> 00:42:53,529
Spare me the drama. You're such a downer.

561
00:42:53,612 --> 00:42:56,282
I have a meeting later with my colleagues.

562
00:42:56,365 --> 00:42:59,994
Why don't you come with me?
Maybe then you'll understand.

563
00:43:01,912 --> 00:43:03,080
Excuse me.

564
00:43:04,623 --> 00:43:06,250
A meeting, huh?

565
00:43:07,960 --> 00:43:09,503
Okay.

566
00:43:09,587 --> 00:43:14,466
Looks like these pesky little
syndicates aren't going to stop.

567
00:43:14,550 --> 00:43:17,136
They're the bane of my existence.

568
00:43:17,219 --> 00:43:18,345
Well…

569
00:43:19,638 --> 00:43:21,974
The lion is not going to sleep

570
00:43:22,057 --> 00:43:28,355
until he puts this pesky
flock of sheep down the drain.

571
00:43:28,439 --> 00:43:30,190
Magbanua.

572
00:43:30,274 --> 00:43:34,862
You are about to watch an actual battle

573
00:43:34,945 --> 00:43:40,784
planned in the true form and art of war.

574
00:43:42,369 --> 00:43:43,454
Watch.

575
00:43:43,537 --> 00:43:48,542
[tense music playing]

576
00:43:59,553 --> 00:44:04,558
[suspenseful music playing]

577
00:44:14,902 --> 00:44:17,237
-There you go, Daddy.
-Thank you.

578
00:44:17,780 --> 00:44:19,198
So, how do I look?

579
00:44:19,782 --> 00:44:24,411
You'll be perfect in about now.
There you go.

580
00:44:24,495 --> 00:44:29,500
[suspenseful music playing]

581
00:44:36,423 --> 00:44:37,257
Let's go.

582
00:44:38,717 --> 00:44:43,931
[suspenseful music playing]

583
00:44:46,684 --> 00:44:50,479
-I'll see you later, Daddy.
-Okay. I'll see you later. Bye.

584
00:44:50,562 --> 00:44:53,649
Bye, Daddy. Bring home the bacon.

585
00:44:58,904 --> 00:45:03,909
[suspenseful music playing]

586
00:45:15,295 --> 00:45:16,630
[Julio] <i>Wherever it is, you're not going.</i>

587
00:45:16,713 --> 00:45:19,508
<i>No, Papa! The lion</i>
<i>is envious of the lioness</i>

588
00:45:19,591 --> 00:45:21,343
<i>because you know that after that meeting,</i>

589
00:45:21,427 --> 00:45:23,804
<i>I'll become even more powerful than you,</i>

590
00:45:23,887 --> 00:45:25,848
<i>and you don't want that. I know you.</i>

591
00:45:25,931 --> 00:45:27,808
[gunshots]

592
00:45:27,891 --> 00:45:29,852
<i>Just make sure you're loyal to Emilia.</i>

593
00:45:29,935 --> 00:45:31,770
<i>Otherwise, you'll get something</i>
<i>far worse than that.</i>

594
00:45:31,854 --> 00:45:34,273
<i>Make sure nothing bad</i>
<i>happens to my daughter.</i>

595
00:45:34,356 --> 00:45:35,732
<i>Diego, we're here.</i>

596
00:45:35,816 --> 00:45:39,194
-<i>Something doesn't feel right.</i>
-[gunshots]

597
00:45:39,278 --> 00:45:40,362
<i>Let's go.</i>

598
00:45:40,446 --> 00:45:42,865
[Arnaldo] <i>You killed the old Arnaldo.</i>

599
00:45:42,948 --> 00:45:45,200
<i>But now that my memories are back,</i>

600
00:45:45,284 --> 00:45:48,120
<i>I will make you pay.</i>

601
00:45:48,203 --> 00:45:50,956
[theme music playing]
